/ 42.5 min | 2.41× cost, 3.32× time | FAIL |\n| gpt-6-luna high, everywhere | $1.26 / 112.0 min | 8.4× cost, 7.5× time | FAIL |\n\n**Re-classified, not recorded as `failing`** (operator decision, 2026-09-29):\n- **The build no longer exists.** 5.0.0 (#851) removed the input layer that cost the luna run 12 spec-plan-review dispatches in the partition loop (#808). So the 4.40.0 figures do not describe the light path that ships now.\n- **The row stays `not-implemented`.** Its notes carry the 4.40.0 result and say the re-run on 5.0.0 is owed, alongside `spec-contract-dry-run`.\n\nThe full table is in the #780 comment.\n\n**Also in this PR: the 5.0.0 artifact migration.** The release moved the installed major, which made one live plan's `fr_version: <5.0.0` stale. The CLI-entry gate then refuses every `fr` command in CI. This PR carries the output of `fr migrate artifacts --yes` (the ceiling becomes `<6.0.0`), not a hand edit.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n- [x] `fr acceptance check` passes: 322 rows OK.\n- [x] `fr validate artifacts` passes.\n- [ ] CI green.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","created_at":"2026-09-29T18:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T19:16:46Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/pulls/852/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/pulls/852/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/852/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/statuses/3b7d41e8589b8afa10bbeb006f02fe3d00477745","head":{"label":"derio-net:docs/r8-light-path-benchmark","ref":"docs/r8-light-path-benchmark","sha":"3b7d41e8589b8afa10bbeb006f02fe3d00477745","user":{"login":"derio-net"